2696| * a real answer (yield summary or turn text), a provider failure carrying the
2697| * attributed `[provider/model] <error>`, a cancellation with its reason, a
2698| * finalization throw, or a turn that ran and produced nothing. A turn that
2699| * yielded an artifact before failing is reported via that artifact's summary
2700| * rather than contradicted with a "no output" claim; a partial-answer waker
2701| * (`alreadyMessaged`) is told the earlier message was not the answer. Every
2702| * non-answer notice carries a `history://<id>` pointer so the peer can inspect
2703| * the transcript. Exported for a focused contract test of the yielded-failure
2704| * branch, which the observer seam cannot drive.
