2640|/**
2641| * Hand a woken subagent's turn output to whoever woke it, when the subagent
2642| * did not answer them itself. A re-`yield` delivers the `<task-result>`
2643| * envelope (the artifact was just rewritten, so it carries the `agent://`
2644| * pointer); a plain turn delivers its final assistant text. Without this, a
2645| * recipient that lacks the `hub` tool — every read-only scout — can never get
2646| * an answer back to a `send await:true` sender, and its re-yield silently
2647| * updates the artifact nobody is told to re-read.
